  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "\tBack in the old days of 199s, Lime was on a family trip with his family.
    Liam was involved in a serious accident. Liam survived, but he lost all four
    of his limbs.\n\n\tSince them, Liam has believed the accident was not a accident,
    but a muder attempt, because how could a car hit only him and dodge everyone
    else in the car? \n\n\tLiam decided to become a detective himself to later find
    out what actually happened in the accident and how. Now, as a dectective, he
    is using evdence form the crime scene to find the culprit. \n \nChoose a scene
    and help Liam find the culprit."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b599552152748794d94e4fa9dc02bd9a, type: 2}
