  m_text: "- By using the mouse or touchpad to move the cursor up or down to adjust
    the screen. \n- Use the WASD or the arrows key to move the player.\n- There will
    be three objects in the crime scene. Find the object and press F to get the list
    objects, which you can chech off by pressing it. \n- Press F to again to remove
    the list from the screen\n- After finding all three of the objects, scroll to
    the bottom of the checklist and press Blame. Choose your suspect and press it. "
